   "title": "表格滚动条显示须整表悬停而非仅表体悬停",
   "type": "fact",
   "content": "根因：`.el-table__body-wrapper:hover::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb` 仅指针近滚动条轨道时生效，悬停表头或单元格不触发。修复：`zhi2-web-admin/src/styles/index.scss` 改用 `.el-table:hover > .el-table__body-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb` 与 `.zs-table-container:hover .el-table__body-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb`，整表悬停显示横向滚动条滑块。",
